WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Usually you don’t need to come to the company to work

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Continue your university studies in Wucheng

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
I can only come and play on the opening day of the big shoot.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
I only work about ten days a year to be smart.

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
So shrewd

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Only come here for a dozen days a year

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Without delaying studies

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
And completely put an end to the rumors of office romance

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All potential risks are avoided

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The boss's business acumen is simply impeccable

11
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,630
But it’s best in Quanyuzhou to have your own boss

12
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:21,860
As for cheating

13
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,860
Company employees are uniformly allocated a Ferrari worth more than 5 million yuan.

14
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:24,860
But you go to school alone in Wucheng

15
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,860
Being too high-profile can easily lead to trouble

16
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,860
It was just the right time to open the two guarantees just now

17
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,860
You've calculated everything

18
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,860
No wonder you can make hundreds of billions

19
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:31,860
What about the house?

20
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:32,860
I don't live in rural areas

21
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,860
I can buy you a house in Wucheng

22
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,980
I don't want a new house

23
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:37,980
You discount

24
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,980
Is it okay if you don’t give me the discounted cash?

25
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,980
Why are you so obsessed with money?

26
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:42,980
Discounted, where do you live?

27
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:43,980
I can't graduate

28
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,980
I'll just stay at your dad and stepmother's house.

29
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:46,980
I'll live in your place

30
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:47,980
The 88 million Long Island estate

31
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:48,980
I was helping you take care of the mansion

32
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,980
No one lives in such a big Dokdo villa
